  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To Contribute Towards the Reduction in Morbidity and Mortality of TB - Madagascar (01-Apr-2016-31-Dec-2017)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar, Tuberculosis, Office National de Nutrition (ONN)This program has the following goals: Reduce the health and economic burden of TB in the population, thereby contributing to socio-economic development in the country. The objectives of this program are: Consildate TB treatment success for all forms of TB across all regions.  Ensure sustainable care and support for TB patients and families.  Increase the number of TB case notifications each year at a rate that exceeds the annual population growth rate of 2.7%.  Maintain drug-resistant TB at low levels.  Strengthen TB program management as an integral part of the health system</narrative>
  </description>
